# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# frontend/.dockerignore
#
# Keeps the Docker build context lean for the frontend image. node_modules/ is
# critical to exclude — without this, Docker would copy tens of thousands of
# files into the build context on every build, causing significant slowdowns
# (especially on Windows with deep paths). dist/ and .vite/ are build artifacts
# that should always be regenerated inside the container, not copied from the
# host. Source code is bind-mounted in development so the COPY . . layer only
# matters for production builds.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

node_modules/
dist/
.vite/
*.local
